    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World War II, the world is in the grip of tyranny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time to fight back has come, a group of heroic pilots from every part of the globe reunites to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look up to the sky! you might be able to see a pig fly today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297720/extras/d4537876c516dfebc789e57a2ecfcfbb.avif?t=1740068541\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying Pigs will let you fly and fight in the skies of World War II.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A catchy aestethic and new mechanics are just parts of this unique arcade shoot 'em up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Flying Pigs</strong> - Take control and unlock six pilots, each of them characterized by a special move and a unique playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297720/extras/13acd6f811c043e0185cfc42ba472c6a.avif?t=1740068541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch your fire</strong> - Use the unique machinegun firing mode to shoot down the enemies, but watch out for overheating or it could be your end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297720/extras/acadd093e783f0b3eee9ede16ca7795e.avif?t=1740068541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to free the world!</strong> - Fight the enemies of freedom in twelve stages and get ready to face incredible boss fights!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297720/extras/47e606f406d5ad8499feebc7379dccf1.avif?t=1740068541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show you skills - </strong>Face your friends in the CHALLENGE MODE<strong> </strong>and show them who's the real ace! Up to four players can play locally!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297720/extras/33874f4e63b37ee190577fcd7b0bdae5.avif?t=1740068541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World War II, the world is in the grip of tyranny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time to fight back has come, a group of heroic pilots from every part of the globe reunites to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look up to the sky! you might be able to see a pig fly today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297720/extras/d4537876c516dfebc789e57a2ecfcfbb.avif?t=1740068541\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying Pigs will let you fly and fight in the skies of World War II.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A catchy aestethic and new mechanics are just parts of this unique arcade shoot 'em up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Flying Pigs</strong> - Take control and unlock six pilots, each of them characterized by a special move and a unique playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297720/extras/13acd6f811c043e0185cfc42ba472c6a.avif?t=1740068541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch your fire</strong> - Use the unique machinegun firing mode to shoot down the enemies, but watch out for overheating or it could be your end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297720/extras/acadd093e783f0b3eee9ede16ca7795e.avif?t=1740068541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to free the world!</strong> - Fight the enemies of freedom in twelve stages and get ready to face incredible boss fights!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297720/extras/47e606f406d5ad8499feebc7379dccf1.avif?t=1740068541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show you skills - </strong>Face your friends in the CHALLENGE MODE<strong> </strong>and show them who's the real ace! Up to four players can play locally!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297720/extras/33874f4e63b37ee190577fcd7b0bdae5.avif?t=1740068541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
